<title>SPAIN: Trade suspended in Spain's Hisalba - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Trade suspended in Spain's Hisalba - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading was suspended on Wednesday in Spanish cement group Hisalba, the stock market commission CNMV said.</p>
<p>The suspension was enforced pending further information relevant to the share price, the CNMV said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
